From: Kurt Himebauch <136133082+xXJSONDeruloXx@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll, rpcrt4, combase: Add what GameInput's redistributable calls next.

GameInputRedist.dll checks token membership with RtlCheckTokenMembershipEx, and
its COM proxies, built by a newer MIDL, import ObjectStublessClient3 to 32
through api-ms-win-core-com-midlproxystub. rpcrt4 already has those thunks;
export them and forward combase's entries to them as Windows does.
